A spelling the glossary replaces.
-- hit/doc-comment --
It hands the work to a sub-agent.
Sub-Agents share the lease.
-- hit/reference --
Spawn one sub-agent per job.
-- pass/doc-comment --
It hands the work to subagents.
-- pass/reference --
Spawn one subagent per job.
The rule refuses the `sub-agent` spelling.
